485
00:25:10,000 --> 00:25:11,151
I had written all night.

486
00:25:11,200 --> 00:25:12,831
He rewrote the whole fucking script.

487
00:25:15,200 --> 00:25:16,300
- Billy, I love it.

488
00:25:17,200 --> 00:25:18,300
It's perfect.

489
00:25:18,453 --> 00:25:20,600
Hey boys, I'm excited to get into this.

490
00:25:21,300 --> 00:25:22,500
Did we pay this guy yet?

491
00:25:24,933 --> 00:25:26,869
- Billy walsh, our director.
- Steve.

492
00:25:30,900 --> 00:25:33,567
$275,000 down the drain.

493
00:25:33,727 --> 00:25:35,348
But I have to admit, the script is good.

494
00:25:35,457 --> 00:25:37,528
- No, it's great.
- It is great.

495
00:25:37,707 --> 00:25:40,699
And Gaghan was kind enough to read it
and agree before he headed back home.

496
00:25:40,700 --> 00:25:42,300
- Thank you so much.
- Hey, no problem.

497
00:25:42,400 --> 00:25:44,300
I've had people read
my work and not like it,

498
00:25:44,400 --> 00:25:47,100
but I've never
had anybody pay me not to work.

499
00:25:48,100 --> 00:25:49,397
It was nice, actually.

500
00:25:50,214 --> 00:25:52,229
FINAL DAY OF PRODUCTION (del vo)

501
00:25:52,477 --> 00:25:53,805
All right, this is our last shot.

502
00:25:53,850 --> 00:25:56,000
Probably the most complicated
of the whole shoot.

503
00:25:56,112 --> 00:25:57,592
And I'm not in it, which is nice.

504
00:25:57,700 --> 00:26:00,032
Which is why we're both
a little toasty right now.

505
00:26:00,800 --> 00:26:02,900
- What?
- You're gonna have to edit that out.

506
00:26:03,791 --> 00:26:05,457
So Eric, what's this scene?

507
00:26:05,900 --> 00:26:09,120
Okay, the army storms Pablo's hideout.

508
00:26:09,600 --> 00:26:12,037
Explosions go off
in the south, east and west.

509
00:26:12,300 --> 00:26:14,514
We have nine cameras
pointed at everything Billy wants.

510
00:26:14,595 --> 00:26:16,937
We've been prepping
this for three months. It has to work.

511
00:26:17,115 --> 00:26:19,592
- We can't do it twice.
- Okay, are you ready for this?

512
00:26:20,500 --> 00:26:22,339
Are we fucking ready?!

513
00:26:24,022 --> 00:26:25,396
Nobody sounds fucking ready.

514
00:26:25,500 --> 00:26:28,200
Hey, get that fucking camera off me.
I'll throw it in the water.

515
00:26:28,488 --> 00:26:29,524
He's nervous.

516
00:26:29,700 --> 00:26:31,126
Looks like he has it under control.

517
00:26:32,500 --> 00:26:33,547
You freaking?

518
00:26:34,700 --> 00:26:35,891
A little bit.

519
00:26:36,630 --> 00:26:39,500
- It's all good, Billy.
- Everything is prepared.

520
00:26:39,700 --> 00:26:42,300
If we get this shot, guys,
we got the whole movie in the can.

521
00:26:43,000 --> 00:26:44,441
Let's do it.
Let's do it.

522
00:26:44,600 --> 00:26:45,841
Let's do it!

523
00:26:47,800 --> 00:26:48,997
Roll cameras!

524
00:26:51,100 --> 00:26:52,500
Set!
We're ready.

525
00:27:22,549 --> 00:27:25,048
Let's kill this motherfucker! (del vo)

526
00:27:50,000 --> 00:27:51,000
Cut!

527
00:27:53,700 --> 00:27:55,950
The start was off, suit.
I'm gonna need another one.

528
00:27:57,500 --> 00:27:59,601
I'm fucking with you.
It was perfect!

529
00:28:05,850 --> 00:28:07,967
- Guys, we did it.
- Yes, we did.

530
00:28:08,077 --> 00:28:10,351
Who would have thought
some kids from Queens could have?

531
00:28:10,352 --> 00:28:12,257
But we did,
and it's gonna be fucking amazing.

532
00:28:12,315 --> 00:28:15,200
I've never felt so good about a movie
after it was done than this one.

533
00:28:16,200 --> 00:28:17,219
I know it.

534
00:28:19,771 --> 00:28:21,100
You think you made a good film?

535
00:28:22,000 --> 00:28:23,000
I'll tell you this:

536
00:28:23,500 --> 00:28:25,995
it's either going to be genius or it's
going to fucking suck.

537
00:28:26,403 --> 00:28:28,300
Until I see the first cut,
I have no idea.

538
00:28:28,453 --> 00:28:31,500
But you know what?
Neither does anybody else.

